    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step away from the world\"... that sounds almost peaceful. like just finally being able to let go of everything. sometimes i look at how much easier it would be to just... cease. to not have to fight to be seen or understood anymore. like there's this quietness waiting at the end of everything. do you think that's a bad thing to want? to just want things to be quiet?",
